# Patch-ID: P-TAB-001 (slice S5, adapter 2) — per-tab media session
# Area: tab.
# Rationale: IPC-CONTRACT section 7 needs addressed-WebContents media state,
#   with playback independent of audibility/mute and no global session proxy.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Dependency: tab/010's typed ServiceEvent sink. Uses the existing
#   media_session::mojom::MediaSessionObserver; no new mojom or Chrome helper.
# Audit: content::MediaSession::Get/AddObserver is per-WebContents and needs
#   no Browser/TabInterface/BrowserWindowInterface. The WebContentsUserData
#   receiver is reset in WebContentsDestroyed; queued callbacks cannot outlive
#   the adapter. Events carry the captured content generation.
# Semantics: inactive -> stopped, otherwise playback_state -> playing/paused;
#   null/disconnected -> unknown; audibility/mute read from WebContents.
#   Null metadata emits a present empty table; no artwork ref. Resume/Suspend
#   use kUI on the addressed existing session with controllable/action checks.
#   WebContents mute works independently. PiP flags remain false; neither
#   native PiP nor PiP control is advertised before controller integration.
# Dormant AttachMediaAdapter seam, called only by future integration after
#   tab.created. Isolated mac :core registration, no frozen-file edits.
# Gate: build-p12 green attempt 1. G1-G5 PASS (G3: grep -qa).
# nm AttachMediaAdapter/MediaSetPlayback/MediaSetMuted symbols verified.
diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
